         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Wakespeed WS500 Data Sheet - 9-26-22W.S5.00.A.DV.A.N.CE.D .DC. C.H.A.RG.E .CO.N.TR.O.LL.ER.The Wakespeed WS500 Advanced Alternator Regulator is the only model on .the market that can utilize current, voltage, and temperature to deliver the most .precise and effective charging possible. Ideal for 12V, 24V, and 48V battery .systems â€“ with configurability for voltages in between â€“ the WS500 is the .perfect solution for charging lead acid-based or new generation LiFePO4 .lithium-ion battery banks.ï»¿ï»¿.ï»¿.ï»¿ ï»¿This Advanced Alternator Regulator can be connected to a current shunt to .monitor current flow to and from the batteries, enabling the regulator to control .charging based on a combination of system voltage and amperage delivered .from the alternator to the batteries. In addition, the WS500 can also monitor .alternator and battery temperatures and modify charging output to ensure .optimal safety and charging performance at the alternator and batteries..     â€¢   Wide ranging support for a variety of battery technologies.     â€¢   Advanced, multi-PID engine control provides the most accurate charging .         availableï»¿.     â€¢   Simple to install, configure, and operate.     â€¢   Best charge control for lithium battery chemistries.     â€¢   Superior protection for your investmentï»¿.ï»¿.  â€¢   ï»¿Adaptive Idle Technology minimizes impact of the regulator on smaller .         engines by controlling alternator loads based on engine RPM.  â€¢   Zero Output Technology enables the regulator to limit output to loads when .          batteries require discounted charging.  â€¢   Provides Multiple Alternator Support without the need for relays or switching .         device.  â€¢   Full BMS Compatibility using RV-C and OSEnergy protocols.Other features of the WS500 include:ï»¿ï»¿.A BOLD NEW SOLUTION FOR BATTERY CHARGING.www.wakespeed.com  |  775.221.8898  |  sales@wakespeed.com.TM.WS500.ADVANCED DC CHARGE CONTROLLER.ADVANCED CONFIGURATION.YES - ON MULTI.ENGINE .APPLICATIONS.YES - DUEL .ALTERNATORS.ON SINGLE .ENGINE .YES.REMOTE.DISPLAY.WARRANTY.US</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
